==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|sg=[[vernal]] [[equinox]]|es}}

# the [[moment]] when the [[sun]] [[appear]]s to [[cross]] the [[celestial equator]], heading [[northward]]
# the [[point]] where the [[ecliptic]] [[intersect]]s the celestial equator at that time

====Synonyms====
* [[spring equinox]]

